% quoted thing
% empty, already written or filtered formula, skipping : ( s__documentation(s__HoleSkinFn__m,s__EnglishLanguage,'"A &%UnaryFunction that maps a &%HoleRegion to the skin of the &%HoleRegion_ The skin of a &%HoleRegion is the fusion of those superficial parts (see &%superficialPart) of the &%HoleRegions principal host (see &%HoleHostFn) with which the &%HoleRegion is externally connected_"') )
